    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lĕmannus</span></b> , i,
		m. (with or without lacus), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the Lake of Geneva</i>.—Without
			lacus: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deseruere cavo tentoria fixa Lemanno,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					1, 396</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 103, 106, §
			224</span></i>.—With lacus: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhodanus, Lemanno lacu acceptus tenet impetum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 5, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 5, 1</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				3, 4, 5, § 33</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 1,
			396</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 6, §
			635</span></i>.</div>
